Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.15,0:00:09.32,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H20&\blur4.5\c&HCDC6C4&\fscx333.75\fscy303.75\frx6\fry4\frz3.308\move(291,90,-180,90,0,1157)}...the messiah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.91,0:00:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to be the messiah?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.91,0:00:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a mad scientist...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.41,0:00:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I desire chaos and destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.34,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll now resume Operation Urd.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Braun's still downstairs, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.35,0:00:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.86,0:00:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm against this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.82,0:00:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Against what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.24,0:00:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Just this morning, you were helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.57,0:00:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.24,0:01:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then... I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.53,0:01:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The experiment already happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.58,0:01:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The D-Mail changed the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The worldline changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.30,0:01:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.42,0:01:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, you've lost some
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.88,0:01:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,of your memories from before the change.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.22,0:01:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this about that LOTO SIX thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.68,0:01:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So why are you the only one who remembers?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.44,0:01:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Titor told me that I have the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.94,0:01:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,To prove it, we'll need to move worldlines again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The power?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.32,0:01:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The power to retain memories, \Neven across worldlines...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.28,0:01:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic eye: Reading Steiner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.42,0:02:05.09,op trans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}Even the billions of heartbeats in the world
