Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.91,0:03:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no record in the outbox...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.75,0:03:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the inbox, \Nthe D-Mail arrived five days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.13,0:03:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the past change?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.39,0:04:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We sent a D-Mail to Daru five days in the past
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.43,0:04:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}telling him the position of the cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.60,0:04:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so he could win the Faris Cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.19,0:04:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick question: in the Faris Cup last week...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.61,0:04:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I lost? Immediately?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.03,0:04:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... Thanks. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.58,0:04:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru's message didn't alter the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,With the way the game went, \Nit should've changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't enough to change worldlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.84,0:04:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we need an easier way to tell
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.22,0:04:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,if the past has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.35,0:04:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's not like I suddenly agree with \Nthese experiments, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.02,0:04:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So... what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.48,0:04:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,About you being the only one to remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.52,0:04:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the power of the magic eye, Reading Steiner!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.41,0:05:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to see if that's true,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have you send the next D-Mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.54,0:05:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Worried about a time paradox?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.63,0:05:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels unfair to change the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.22,0:05:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I've only lived 18 years, \Nbut I wouldn't change any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.85,0:05:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all part of my life, even the failures.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But you love experiments, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.73,0:05:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Is that so wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.31,0:05:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, you'll just sit back and watch
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.32,0:05:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,as others sacrifice themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.61,0:05:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A true mad scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.99,0:05:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:50.66,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.4\fscx68.75\fscy75\frx16\fry358\pos(972,333)\frz11.615}Please
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:50.66,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8\c&HDAD6D8&\frx2\fry358\fscx71.25\fscy82.5\pos(676.5,579)\frz13.735}I want to send a D-Mail too{\c&H4931BB&} !\N{\c&HDAD6D8&}Moeka
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.29,0:05:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But seriously, if we're going to perfect the D-Mail...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.63,0:05:57.84,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.4\frx16\fry358\fscx73.75\fscy88.75\frz11.934\pos(894,300)}Please{\c&H7E6DD4&} ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.63,0:05:57.84,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8\c&HDAD6D8&\frx2\fry358\fscx82.5\fscy87.5\pos(615,652.5)\frz13.874}It's okay, right {\c&H4931BB&}? \N{\c&HDAD6D8&}Please {\c&H4931BB&}! \N{\c&HDAD6D8&}Moeka
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.63,0:06:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...we'll have to continue our experiments...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:04.55,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\frx16\fry358\frz12.982\fscx93.75\fscy108.75\pos(930,147)}I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:04.55,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.4\c&HDAD6D8&\frx2\fry358\frz13.392\fscx95\fscy97.5\pos(553.5,499.5)}A lab mem too, right{\c&H4931BB&} ? \N{\c&HDAD6D8&}Moeka
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.01,0:06:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiryu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.22,0:06:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.40,0:06:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,She overwhelmed us...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.28,0:06:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Those crêpes were good...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You look bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.25,0:06:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.75,0:06:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't scare Nae!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.09,0:06:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Nae.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.01,0:06:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's leave this loser alone and go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.05,0:06:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Big sis!{says Mayuri too, but sounds awkward}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.85,0:06:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.60,0:06:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.77,0:07:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's one for Okarin too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.36,0:07:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Suzu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the part-timer girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey... What happened after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.62,0:07:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.54,0:07:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The time machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.38,0:07:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you ask John Titor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I don't know if \Nwhat he says is accurate...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Which part?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.60,0:07:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.47,0:07:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a Titor fanatic{otaku}, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.56,0:07:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.44,0:07:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.87,0:07:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,More sparks between you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's her problem, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.67,0:07:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting makes me sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.58,0:08:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.63,0:08:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,No private messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.84,0:08:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We want something simple that'll make it clear
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.22,0:08:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,whether the past has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.35,0:08:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,"I changed my cell phone four days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.77,0:08:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and I want to tell myself not to do it."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.52,0:08:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So if the past changes, \Nyou'll have a different cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.65,0:08:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.24,0:08:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's begin the experiment!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.17,0:08:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All right! Activate the PhoneWave \N(name subject to change)!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so round...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.89,0:08:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.35,0:08:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I used the wrong number for \Nthe LOTO SIX you asked me about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.64,0:08:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.19,0:09:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.23,0:09:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Good... Good to hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.40,0:09:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The day nears when your heart's eye will open.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.24,0:09:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.07,0:09:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you'll excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.03,0:09:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.36,0:09:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.66,0:09:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wear Mayushii's cosplay sometime soon, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not really into that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.38,0:09:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So you won't?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.96,0:09:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'd look great...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.72,0:09:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.93,0:09:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Good kid, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.18,0:09:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This feeling again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.67,0:10:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the past has changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.10,0:10:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Where's Shining Finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.35,0:10:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Shi...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.31,0:10:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Japanese, do you speak it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Lukako didn't stop by?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.37,0:10:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Lukako? Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.54,0:10:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Moeka... Where's Moeka?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Moeka? Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.34,0:10:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiryu Moeka!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.84,0:10:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She wasn't here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.47,0:10:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.68,0:10:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.51,0:11:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiryu Moeka... I've never heard that name before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.35,0:11:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Another D-Mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.19,0:11:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.15,0:11:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The past changed, and Moeka's very existence was erased?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.07,0:11:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Up to July 31st, my inbox still has messages from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.25,0:11:27.21,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\b1\blur2.25\c&H131317&\pos(894.3,818.4)\frz6.331\frx2\fry8}Sending...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.59,0:11:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"Something wrong?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.80,0:11:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sorry, I'm kind of busy."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.89,0:11:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'll message you later."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.93,0:11:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,the past altered in such a way that, \Never since four days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.31,0:11:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,when she received that message,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.40,0:11:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,this Kiryu... Moeka person
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.23,0:11:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,changed her actions and never came to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:11:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.53,0:12:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And this time, only you remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The Reading Steiner, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.33,0:12:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, just saying that is embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.92,0:12:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you should call it that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.88,0:12:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in your personal opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.71,0:12:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The power to retain memories across worldlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.02,0:12:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll talk tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.02,0:12:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow, Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.61,0:12:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I really do have that ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.36,0:12:40.11,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(481,481)\blur1.5\an8\q2\fscx253.75\fscy230\c&HC6C0BF&\move(1560,145.5,-450,145.5,0,2775)\fax0.15\frx0\fry2\frz2.682}I want you to be the messiah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.78,0:12:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.07,0:12:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed they can sleep at the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.67,0:12:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He said it's because he's a mad scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.63,0:12:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I know! Let's all sleep over at the lab next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.55,0:12:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only if the guys aren't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.34,0:13:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. Why not come to my hotel?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.55,0:13:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.72,0:13:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.81,0:13:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll come over soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.94,0:13:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Luka?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.07,0:13:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.78,0:13:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't bring the magical blade, Samidare?{Samidare=Eary Summer Rain}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.16,0:13:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.99,0:13:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that, Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.87,0:13:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, Luka is my guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.66,0:13:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to wear my cosplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.13,0:13:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.79,0:13:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Let's transform, Luka. Transform!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.09,0:13:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I mean, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.30,0:13:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take off your clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't touch me there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.60,0:13:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put it on myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.18,0:13:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,so allow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.02,0:13:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to know the trick to putting this on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.48,0:13:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,P-Please... don't take off my clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:13:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This is quite lesbian.{very yuri}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.19,0:14:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Except Lukako's a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.36,0:14:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Which makes it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.49,0:14:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,even better!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.96,0:14:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Kirari from Rai-Net.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.17,0:14:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're as cute as I imagined, Luka!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.47,0:14:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Cute is justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.05,0:14:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to get a low-angle shot of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.85,0:14:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I've just been victimized by a \Nfierce psychological attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.11,0:14:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My soul... My soul is being devoured!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.24,0:14:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's wrong, Kyouma?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.99,0:14:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.87,0:14:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.17,0:15:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop staring, my perverted assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.63,0:15:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not staring!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.05,0:15:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Even more win!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.34,0:15:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think of this cosplay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.76,0:15:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it look good?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.01,0:15:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's very cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Cute... Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's try on the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.36,0:15:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here because I had a request for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.24,0:15:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't come here to wear my cosplay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I said, "No," but you wouldn't listen to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.33,0:15:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I was just really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.29,0:15:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So what did you want to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.42,0:15:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to let me send a message to the past!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.17,0:15:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.51,0:15:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I came by to apologize for messing up\Nthe LOTO SIX, but before I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.31,0:15:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Another D-Mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.39,0:15:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wh-What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:16:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The past changed, and Moeka's very existence was erased?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.19,0:16:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.69,0:16:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for eavesdropping when I shouldn't have!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.74,0:16:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Luka, what kind of message \Ndo you want to send to the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.54,0:16:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.17,0:16:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.13,0:16:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like the way I look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'd feel better about myself if I was a girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.72,0:16:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always felt that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait a second...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.98,0:16:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What is she saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.90,0:16:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Assistant, you appear to have \Nmade a fatal mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.65,0:16:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.28,0:16:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Lukako is no girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.24,0:16:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of joke is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.58,0:16:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't believe me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you call yourself a scientist, \Nthen see for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a cute girl couldn't be a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.92,0:17:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.35,0:17:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.43,0:17:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.44,0:17:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I really want to be a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.23,0:17:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.73,0:17:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't know if sending a D-Mail
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.90,0:17:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,would be enough to change your gender.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.74,0:17:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard about this thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If you eat lots of meat \Nwhen a baby is in your tummy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.45,0:17:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll have a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.95,0:17:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,With a lot of vegetables, you'll have a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.75,0:17:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You want us to send a D-Mail telling your mom
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.25,0:17:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,to eat lots of vegetables?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.88,0:17:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Would that be possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.92,0:17:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.05,0:17:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall grant your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.72,0:17:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.26,0:17:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for you, Luka!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.31,0:17:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.31,0:18:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't changing someone's gender a bad idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.48,0:18:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think it's possible to affect it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.35,0:18:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,just by eating vegetables?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,True enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.69,0:18:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no scientific evidence for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.07,0:18:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He must've really been worried about it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.11,0:18:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,if that made him feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.57,0:18:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Lukako, from now on, you're Lab Mem 006!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.49,0:18:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's begin the experiment...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.33,0:18:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. You're 17 this year, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.71,0:18:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, you were born in 1993.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.13,0:18:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.92,0:18:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,When did cell phones become popular in Japan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.43,0:18:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like it was around 1996,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.35,0:18:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and only later did they get messaging capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, when he was born,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.81,0:18:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a good chance his mom \Ndidn't own a cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.53,0:18:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can't send the D-Mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.95,0:18:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.49,0:18:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We could change it so it sends sinister microwaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.49,0:19:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You have enough sinister microwaves for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.95,0:19:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Good... Insult me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.12,0:19:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.25,0:19:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm terrified by my own talent!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.30,0:19:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not this again...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,479)}If she doesn't have a cell phone, \Nsend it to her pager!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.10,0:19:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagers...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.18,0:19:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A system using EM waves to \Ntransmit messages to small receivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.97,0:19:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,During the 1990s, \Nthey enjoyed enormous popularity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.52,0:19:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The emergence of cellular phones \Nrendered them obsolete.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.48,0:19:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Pagers?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.48,0:19:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're very knowledgeable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.53,0:19:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you're a Cell-Pager, not Celeb Sev?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.49,0:19:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's written right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.91,0:19:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not read it yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.70,0:19:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Lab Mem 006, Urushibara Luka!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.66,0:19:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for your first mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.41,0:19:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Find out if your mother had a pager
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and acquire that number!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.21,0:19:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.63,0:19:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom had a pager!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.97,0:19:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the number.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.55,0:19:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.01,0:20:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You've thought about what to write, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.35,0:20:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.10,0:20:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,"Eat vegetables for a healthy child."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.68,0:20:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you can only send 18 hiragana...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.31,0:20:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You can only send numbers to a pager.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.98,0:20:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,To transform these to numbers...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.11,0:20:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,One sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.32,0:20:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You need two digits for voiced consonants.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.41,0:20:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.41,0:20:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You can send a total of 36 English letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.49,0:20:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That message puts you four characters over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.75,0:20:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.00,0:20:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we turn this into numbers?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:31.42,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.85\pos(370.5,598.5)\fscx68.75\fscy71.25\frz354.272\c&H5F5647&}Eat veggies for a healthy child.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.50,0:20:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, starting it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.42,0:20:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.30,0:20:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.43,0:20:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.91,0:21:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My Reading Steiner activated!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.29,0:21:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.33,0:21:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I see... Some people are like that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Luka, I think you'd look great \Nin something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.55,0:21:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.14,0:21:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.76,0:21:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.14,0:21:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you staring?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.31,0:21:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.98,0:21:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.31,0:21:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's difficult to ask if Lukako became a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.11,0:21:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.15,0:21:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.86,0:21:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what kind of perverted things are you imagining?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.74,0:21:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.33,0:21:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take my eyes off \Nyou two perverts for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.37,0:21:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a pervert! I'm a perverted gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter! It honestly doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.34,0:22:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.13,0:22:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the worldline changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.97,0:22:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.14,0:22:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but what?
